(7143637, 1094550, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am humbly sorry, Alessandro. I gave this a 5. Don''t misunderstand, this is a strong, workmanlike, image  but really, when will you step up your game? You have so much creativity! So much energy! So much originality! When will you break out of the DPC (popularity contest) mold?? Will you show me your very best? Your most creative? Your highest style?<br/> <br/>I have lived and worked long time in Italy. A country that values creativity and style. I love Italy as my <i><b>second home</b></i>, and in many respects my muse.<br/> <br/>You''re Italian, you have more to give, more to show, more to create!!!!!<br/> <br/>Mio fratello, il mio amico ... mostrami il tuo meglio!</td>', 'I am humbly sorry, Alessandro. I gave this a 5. Don''t misunderstand, this is a strong, workmanlike, image  but really, when will you step up your game? You have so much creativity! So much energy! So much originality! When will you break out of the DPC (popularity contest) mold?? Will you show me your very best? Your most creative? Your highest style? I have lived and worked long time in Italy. A country that values creativity and style. I love Italy as my second home, and in many respects my muse. You''re Italian, you have more to give, more to show, more to create!!!!! Mio fratello, il mio amico ... mostrami il tuo meglio!', '2013-12-17 01:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
