(7148180, 1094571, 14476, '<td valign="top">Until I read the comments below, I also didn''t see the bird.<br/>The subject appeared to be a ''product shot'' and those tend not to score well at DPC.<br/>Suggestion:  If you have the pixels, zero in on the bird and perhaps just the Nikon emblem &amp; the lens the bird''s perched on.<br/>If you have more background, include it.  Then see if you have a different, perhaps more complete &amp; humerous story.<br/>Okay, I did a screen grab. This is pretty much what I meant.<br/>:)<br/>Alice<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1096319" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/14476/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1096319.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/14476/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1096319.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/14476/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1096319.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Until I read the comments below, I also didn''t see the bird.The subject appeared to be a ''product shot'' and those tend not to score well at DPC.Suggestion:  If you have the pixels, zero in on the bird and perhaps just the Nikon emblem & the lens the bird''s perched on.If you have more background, include it.  Then see if you have a different, perhaps more complete & humerous story.Okay, I did a screen grab. This is pretty much what I meant.:)Alice', '2013-12-27 12:43:36.000000', NULL, 0),
